 "intro_zh": "邯郸市广府古城距今已有2000多年的历史。隋末农民起义领袖窦建德曾在此创建大夏国，使其具备了城池规模。广府有很多历史遗存，如清晖书院、文庙大殿（遗址）、毛遂墓、黑龙潭，武氏故居、状元楼、太和堂等等。",
 "intro_en": "The ancient city of Guangfu in Handan City has a history of more than 2,000 years. Dou Jiande, the leader of the peasant uprising in the late Sui Dynasty, founded the Daxia Kingdom here, giving it the size of a city. Guangfu has many historical relics, such as Qinghui Academy, Confucian Temple Hall (site), Mao Sui's Tomb, Black Dragon Pond, Wu's former residence, Zhuangyuan Tower, Taihe Hall, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
